{{!
    @template mod_these/status_counts

    Décompte des dossiers par statut, en badges cliquables séparés par une espace. Rien n'est rendu
    sans dossier.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * hasbadges Au moins un statut a des dossiers.
    * badges Badges : label, url, class, separator (espace avant le badge).

    Example context (json):
    {"hasbadges": true, "badges": [
        {"label": "Dossier actif : 3", "url": "https://example.com/mod/these/dashboard.php?id=2&status=40",
            "class": "badge badge-success mr-1 mb-1 p-2", "separator": false},
        {"label": "Dossier clos : 1", "url": "https://example.com/mod/these/dashboard.php?id=2&status=100",
            "class": "badge badge-dark mr-1 mb-1 p-2", "separator": true}
    ]}
}}
{{#hasbadges}}
<div class="these-counts mb-3">{{#badges}}{{#separator}} {{/separator}}<a href="{{url}}" class="{{class}}">{{label}}</a>{{/badges}}</div>
{{/hasbadges}}
